        }
      ],
      "examplePrompts": [
        {
          "zh-CN": "DNA复制以后，染色体数为什么没有翻倍？",
          "en": "Why does DNA replication not double the chromosome count?"
        },
        {
          "zh-CN": "对比减数第一次和第二次分裂分开的是什么",
          "en": "Compare what separates in meiosis I and meiosis II."
        }
      ],
